      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Shared procedure for 1–4: to a stirred MeCN solution of mosaoH, [Fe3O(piv)6(OH2)2(OH)]·H2O and Ln(NO3)3·6H2O was added N-mdeaH and NEt3. The crimson solution was stirred 30 min, filtered, and the filtrate left at room temperature for three days to give prismatic crimson crystals (35% yield based on Ln).",
